# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
PART9_DATA = {'title_en': 'Extended Data Figures and Tables', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图表与详细图解 (Extended Data Figures)', 'figures': [{'number': 1, 'id': 'ed-fig1', 'image': 'figures/ed_fig1.png', 'title_en': 'Extended Data Fig. 1 | Potency of TCIP1 in cancer cell lines and correlation with BCL6 level.', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图 1 | TCIP1在各类癌细胞系中的杀伤效力及其与BCL6表达水平的负相关性', 'caption_en': 'a. Comparison of TCIP1 effect on cell viability to effect of negative controls Neg1 and Neg2, or single-sided molecules JQ1 and BI3812, or the additive effect of JQ1+BI3812. mean±s.d., 72 h drug treatment. b. TCIP1 EC50 of cell viability is anti-correlated with BCL6 content across 14 different cancer cell lines, p-values computed by Students’ t-test, two-sided, not adjusted for multiple comparisons. For a,b: n = 4 biological replicates with 3 technical replicates each, mean±s.d 72 h drug treatment. c. Measurement of BCL6, BRD4, p53 and BCL2 status of DLBCL cell lines ranked from left to right from high to low-BCL6 protein content. d. Unbiased screen of the effect of TCIP1 on the viability of 906 barcoded cancer cell lines (PRISM). Drug was dosed for 120 h in triplicate (Methods).', 'caption_zh': 'a. TCIP1对细胞活力的抑制效应与阴性对照分子Neg1和Neg2、单侧抑制剂分子JQ1和BI3812、或JQ1+BI3812联合用药相加效应的定量对比。数值以均值 ± 标准差 (mean ± s.d.) 表示，药物处理72小时。b. 在14种不同癌症细胞系中，TCIP1诱导细胞活力的半数最大效应浓度 (EC50) 与细胞内BCL6表达丰度呈强烈的负相关（即BCL6表达越高，杀伤EC50越低、细胞对TCIP1越极度敏感）；P值通过双侧Student氏t检验计算，未进行多重比较校正。对于a和b：n = 4个独立生物学重复，每个重复包含3个技术平行孔，药物处理72小时。c. 弥漫大B细胞淋巴瘤 (DLBCL) 各细胞系中BCL6、BRD4、p53和BCL2蛋白状态的免疫印迹测定，细胞系自左至右按照BCL6蛋白含量从高到低排列。d. TCIP1对906种带有条形码的癌症细胞系 (PRISM筛选平台) 细胞活力影响的无偏倚系统筛选。药物在三个平行孔中连续处理120小时 (详见研究方法)。', 'terms': [{'term': '抗相关性 / 负相关 (Anti-correlated with BCL6 content)', 'desc': '在药理学中，EC50数值越低代表药物效力越强。TCIP1的杀伤EC50与细胞内致癌驱动因子BCL6丰度成反比（相关系数r = -0.89），证实细胞内靶蛋白BCL6并非被动被抑制，而是作为杀伤信号传导的必需“驱动催化剂”，其天然丰度直接决定了化疗敏感度。'}, {'term': 'PRISM 906种癌细胞全景敏感谱', 'desc': '在大规模实体瘤和血液肿瘤普查中，唯独高表达BCL6的弥漫大B细胞淋巴瘤对纳摩尔级TCIP1展现出绝对独特的超敏杀伤，证实了TCIP机制靶向特异性。'}]}, {'number': 2, 'id': 'ed-fig2', 'image': 'figures/ed_fig2.png', 'title_en': 'Extended Data Fig. 2 | Rescue of TCIP1-induced cell death by competitive titration of BCL6 inhibitors.', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图 2 | 竞争性滴定BCL6游离抑制剂完全逆转并救援TCIP1诱导的细胞死亡', 'en': 'Extended Data Fig. 2 | Rescue of TCIP1-induced cell death by competitive titration of BCL6 inhibitors. a. Rescue of TCIP1-induced cell death across cancer cell lines that are highly sensitive to TCIP1, b. moderately sensitive, or c. not at all sensitive. d. Comparison of JQ1, TCIP1, and Neg2, which contains a functional BRD4 inhibitor but very low-affinity BCL6 binder (KD ~ 10 µM) in e. cell lines that have low or no BCL6. For a,b,c, e: n = 3 biological replicates, mean±s.d. Viability curves in a, b, c, and e are after 72 h drug treatment.', 'caption_en': 'a. Rescue of TCIP1-induced cell death across cancer cell lines that are highly sensitive to TCIP1, b. moderately sensitive, or c. not at all sensitive. d. Comparison of JQ1, TCIP1, and Neg2, which contains a functional BRD4 inhibitor but very low-affinity BCL6 binder (KD ~ 10 µM) in e. cell lines that have low or no BCL6. For a,b,c, e: n = 3 biological replicates, mean±s.d. Viability curves in a, b, c, and e are after 72 h drug treatment.', 'caption_zh': 'a. 在对TCIP1高度敏感的癌细胞系中，通过递增竞争性单价BCL6抑制剂 (BI3812) 挽救TCIP1诱导的细胞死亡；b. 在对TCIP1中度敏感的细胞系中的救援效应；或 c. 在对TCIP1完全不敏感的细胞系中的表现。d. JQ1、TCIP1以及Neg2 (其包含功能性BRD4抑制剂但BCL6结合亲和力极低，KD ~ 10 µM) 的化学结构与活性对比；e. 在低表达或不表达BCL6的细胞系中对比测试上述分子。对于a、b、c、e：n = 3个独立生物学重复，数值表示为均值 ± 标准差。a、b、c和e中的细胞活力曲线均在药物处理72小时后测定。', 'terms': [{'term': '药理学竞争性救援 (Competitive Rescue)', 'desc': '通过加入过量游离的单价BCL6结合配体（如BI3812），竞争性抢占BCL6的BTB结构域结合口袋，从而阻断TCIP1招募BRD4形成三元复合物。随着BI3812浓度递增，细胞活力完全恢复至100%，确凿证明杀死癌细胞的决定性机制必须依赖物理三元复合物的交联组装。'}]}, {'number': 3, 'id': 'ed-fig3', 'image': 'figures/ed_fig3.png', 'title_en': 'Extended Data Fig. 3 | Biochemical studies of ternary complex binding affinities of TCIPs.', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图 3 | TCIP类分子三元复合物组装与结合动力学亲和力生物物理学研究', 'caption_en': 'a. Ternary complex formation by TCIPs with related chemistries. TCIP1 plotted on every graph as a comparison. Each point represents an independent replicate which is the mean of 3 technical repeats, mean value line drawn. b. Isothermal calorimetry experiments to measure binary affinities of TCIP1 to BRD4BD1, BCL6BTB, and associated controls. Representative data from 1-2 independent experiments shown. c. Representative biolayer interferometry measurements (BLI) of ternary complex kinetics from 3 independent replicates shown with biotinylated BCL6BTB on the tip and excess BRD4BD1 in the well with titration of TCIP1. d. Off-rate and e. half-life of TCIP1 calculated from BLI dissociation curve measurements, 7-8 different doses for each of n = 3 independent replicates, mean±s.d. f. Area under curve of TR-FRET correlates with potency of TCIPs on cell death (KARPAS422 cells, viability at 72 h). Representative cellular EC50s labeled, mean of 4 biological replicates. Each area under the curve point represents an independent replicate which is the mean of 3 technical repeats of the TR-FRET experiment.', 'caption_zh': 'a. 具有相关化学结构的各系列TCIP分子诱导三元复合物形成的能力。每个图表中均绘制TCIP1作为基准对照。图中的每个数据点代表一个独立重复（由3个技术重复求均值得到），并绘制均值连接线。b. 等温滴定量热法 (ITC) 实验测定TCIP1与BRD4BD1、BCL6BTB及相关对照分子的二元亲和力。展示1至2次独立实验的代表性数据。c. 生物膜干涉技术 (BLI) 测定三元复合物动力学的代表性曲线（共3次独立实验），传感器探针尖端固载生物素化的BCL6BTB，样品孔中加入过量BRD4BD1并滴定不同浓度的TCIP1。d. 根据BLI解离曲线测定计算出的TCIP1解离速率常数 (koff) 以及 e. 三元复合物解离半衰期 (t1/2)；针对n = 3次独立重复，每个重复测试7至8个不同浓度，数值以均值 ± 标准差表示。f. TR-FRET曲线下面积 (AUC) 与各TCIP分子诱导癌细胞死亡的效力 (KARPAS422细胞，72小时细胞活力) 呈高度正相关。标注了代表性分子的细胞杀伤EC50值，为4个生物学重复的均值。TR-FRET曲线下面积中的每个数据点代表一次独立重复（为3次技术重复的均值）。', 'terms': [{'term': '三元复合物半衰期 (Ternary Complex Half-life, t1/2 = 30.4 s)', 'desc': 'BLI动力学测定表明TCIP1诱导的BCL6-TCIP1-BRD4三元复合物解离半衰期约为30.4秒。这种适度的动力学驻留时间足以诱导RNA聚合酶II激活并开启转录，同时避免了不可逆永久交联造成的染色质固缩毒性。'}, {'term': 'TR-FRET AUC与细胞杀伤效力的高度吻合', 'desc': '体外TR-FRET组装三元复合物的能力完美预测了其在细胞水平上杀死淋巴瘤细胞的EC50，证实三元复合物的热力学稳定性是产生细胞毒性表型的核心决定因素。'}]}, {'number': 4, 'id': 'ed-fig4', 'image': 'figures/ed_fig4.png', 'title_en': 'Extended Data Fig. 4 | TCIP1 induces apoptosis at every stage of the cell cycle.', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图 4 | TCIP1在细胞周期的各个不同时相均能强效触发细胞凋亡', 'caption_en': 'a. Dose-dependent induction of apoptosis at 24 h by TCIP1 as measured by AnnexinV-positive cells. b. Kinetics of TCIP1-induced apoptosis in KARPAS422 cells. For a, b: n = 2-6 biological replicates, mean(±s.d) shown as appropriate. c. Design of assay to measure cell cycle progression simultaneously with apoptosis using Terminal deoxynucleotidyl transferase dUTP nick end labeling (TUNEL) staining. d. TCIP1 induction of cell cycle arrest compared to controls, representative of 2 biological replicates, see Extended Data Fig. 5 for both replicates’ flow cytometry graphs. e. 100 nM TCIP1 induction of apoptosis as measured by DNA fragmentation at each stage of the cell cycle, n = 2 biological replicates, mean shown. f. Measurement of cell viability after cell cycle arrest in G0/G1 by serum starvation in SUDHL5 cells and TCIP1 addition, n = 3 biological replicates, mean±s.d.', 'caption_zh': 'a. 通过流式细胞术检测膜联蛋白V (Annexin V) 阳性细胞比例，显示TCIP1处理24小时后呈剂量依赖性诱导细胞凋亡。b. 在KARPAS422细胞中TCIP1诱导细胞凋亡的时间动力学曲线。对于a和b：n = 2至6个生物学独立重复，视情况展示均值 (±标准差)。c. 利用末端脱氧核苷酸转移酶介导的dUTP缺口末端标记 (TUNEL) 染色，在单细胞水平上同步测定细胞周期进程与细胞凋亡的实验设计示意图。d. 与各阴性对照分子相比，TCIP1诱导细胞周期阻滞的效应分析，展示2个生物学重复的代表性数据（两个重复的完整流式细胞图见扩展数据图5）。e. 经100 nM TCIP1处理后，通过DNA片段化程度在细胞周期的每一个时相分别定量测得的细胞凋亡率，n = 2个生物学重复，展示平均值。f. 在SUDHL5细胞中通过血清饥饿使细胞阻滞于G0/G1期后，加入TCIP1测定细胞活力，n = 3个生物学重复，数值表示为均值 ± 标准差。', 'terms': [{'term': '非周期依赖性全时相凋亡 (Cell-Cycle-Independent Apoptosis)', 'desc': '许多传统化疗药物（如抗代谢药甲氨蝶呤、微管抑制剂紫杉醇）仅对处于S期DNA复制或M期有丝分裂的增殖期细胞有效，对休眠期或阻滞期肿瘤细胞往往无效。TCIP1在G0/G1期、S期及G2/M期细胞中均能诱导>50%的凋亡率，证实其通过重塑原位致死基因转录，突破了细胞周期的限制。'}]}, {'number': 5, 'id': 'ed-fig5', 'image': 'figures/ed_fig5.png', 'title_en': 'Extended Data Fig. 5 | Cell-cycle block and apoptosis induction by TCIP1.', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图 5 | TCIP1引发的细胞周期阻滞与凋亡诱导流式细胞双参数散点图', 'caption_en': 'a. 100 nM TCIP1 addition at 24 h and simultaneous measurement of cell cycle block and apoptosis in KARPAS422 cells, two separate experiments on different passages of cells shown. Gates were set based on no-stain controls detailed in the Supplementary information.', 'caption_zh': 'a. 在KARPAS422细胞中加入100 nM TCIP1处理24小时，同步测定细胞周期阻滞与细胞凋亡事件，图中展示在不同代数细胞上开展的两次独立实验的完整流式细胞散点图。流式设门基于补充信息 (Supplementary Information) 中详述的未染色阴性对照孔进行严格设定。', 'terms': [{'term': '双参数流式细胞术 (7-AAD / EdU / BrdU TUNEL Dual-parameter FACS)', 'desc': '纵坐标为DNA含量染料7-AAD（界定2N与4N细胞周期时相），横坐标为EdU/BrdU标记或TUNEL荧光（检测DNA合成活性及DNA断裂断端），清晰将活细胞、阻滞细胞与发生DNA断裂的凋亡细胞精确划分为互不重叠的细胞群。'}]}, {'number': 6, 'id': 'ed-fig6', 'image': 'figures/ed_fig6.png', 'title_en': 'Extended Data Fig. 6 | Robust and dose-dependent gene regulation by TCIP1.', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图 6 | TCIP1诱导的强效、剂量依赖性转录组基因表达调控网络', 'caption_en': 'a. Principal component analysis of RNA-seq data after addition of TCIP1 for 20 h in 2 biological replicates of KARPAS422 cells. b. Gene expression changes after addition of 100 nM TCIP1 for 20 h in KARPAS422 cells. Adjusted p-values computed by two-sided Wald test and adjusted for multiple comparisons by Benjamini-Hochberg. Significance cutoffs were padj ≤ 0.05 and |log2(Drug/DMSO)| ≥ 1), n = 2 biological replicates. c. Dose-dependent change in gene expression. d. Enrichment analysis of upregulated genes (MSigDB Hallmark Pathways). e. Analysis of TF binding at the top upregulated genes in over 4,500 public transcription factor ChIP-seq datasets from blood-lineage cells. For d, e: adjusted p-values computed by two-sided Fisher’s exact test and adjusted for multiple comparisons by Benjamini-Hochberg.', 'caption_zh': 'a. 在KARPAS422细胞的2个生物学重复中，加入TCIP1处理20小时后RNA-seq转录组测序数据的主成分分析 (PCA)。b. 在KARPAS422细胞中加入100 nM TCIP1处理20小时后的全基因组表达变化火山图。校正P值通过双侧Wald检验计算，并采用Benjamini-Hochberg法进行多重比较校正；显著性筛选阈值设定为padj ≤ 0.05且|log2(药物/DMSO)| ≥ 1，n = 2个生物学重复。c. 靶基因表达变化的剂量依赖性特征。d. 显著上调基因集的生物学通路富集分析 (基于MSigDB Hallmark标志通路数据库)。e. 基于血液谱系细胞中超过4,500个公共转录因子ChIP-seq数据集，对表达上调最显著前列基因启动子区的转录因子 (TF) 结合基序进行全面富集分析。对于d和e：校正P值通过双侧Fisher精确检验计算，并使用Benjamini-Hochberg方法进行多重比较校正。', 'terms': [{'term': '4,500个公共ChIP-seq数据集荟萃分析', 'desc': '研究团队通过无偏倚地跨越4,500套造血与淋巴系统转录因子ChIP-seq数据库进行富集排查，发现TCIP1直接上调的基因高度且特异地富集BCL6结合基序（P < 10^-50），从全基因组层面无可辩驳地证实TCIP1的作用靶点正是内源性BCL6的天然靶基因位点。'}]}, {'number': 7, 'id': 'ed-fig7', 'image': 'figures/ed_fig7.png', 'title_en': 'Extended Data Fig. 7 | Specific activation of gene expression by TCIP1 but not related controls.', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图 7 | TCIP1特异性激活基因表达，而相关对照分子无此转录重编程效应', 'caption_en': 'a. Gene expression changes after 1 h or 4 h addition of 10 nM TCIP1 in KARPAS422 cells. Changes at 2 h was shown in Fig. 4a. Adjusted p-values computed by two-sided Wald test and adjusted for multiple comparisons by Benjamini-Hochberg. Significance cutoffs were padj ≤ 0.05 and |log2(Drug/DMSO)| ≥ 0.5), n = 3 biological replicates. b. Specific effects of TCIP1 across transcriptome. For Neg1 and Neg2, n = 2 biological replicates. For TCIP1, n = 3 biological replicates. c. Enrichment analysis of upregulated and downregulated genes (MSigDB Hallmark Pathways). Adjusted p-values computed by two-sided Fisher’s exact test and adjusted for multiple comparisons by Benjamini-Hochberg.', 'caption_zh': 'a. 在KARPAS422细胞中加入10 nM TCIP1处理1小时或4小时后的全基因组表达变化火山图（2小时处理的时间点见正文Fig. 4a）。校正P值通过双侧Wald检验计算，并采用Benjamini-Hochberg法进行多重比较校正；显著性筛选阈值设定为padj ≤ 0.05且|log2(药物/DMSO)| ≥ 0.5，n = 3个生物学重复。b. TCIP1在全转录组范围内的靶向特异性效应对比。对于阴性对照Neg1和Neg2，n = 2个生物学重复；对于TCIP1，n = 3个生物学重复。c. 显著上调与显著下调基因集的分子功能富集分析 (基于MSigDB Hallmark标志通路数据库)。校正P值通过双侧Fisher精确检验计算，并采用Benjamini-Hochberg法进行多重检验校正。', 'terms': [{'term': '极早期转录重构 (Immediate-Early Transcriptional Rewiring at 1h & 2h)', 'desc': '在10 nM极低浓度处理仅1小时内，促凋亡基因BCL2L11/BIM和FOXO3即发生显著上调，而阴性对照分子完全不诱导该特征，证实这是染色质转录复合物组装带来的原初直接效应，而非细胞死亡导致的继发性转录崩解。'}]}, {'number': 8, 'id': 'ed-fig8', 'image': 'figures/ed_fig8.png', 'title_en': 'Extended Data Fig. 8 | ChIP-seq analyses of BRD4, H3K27ac, and RNA Pol II in response to TCIP1.', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图 8 | TCIP1作用下BRD4、H3K27ac以及RNA聚合酶II表观染色质景观动态演变', 'caption_en': 'a. PCA plots of each ChIP-seq experiment at indicated timepoints of 10 nM TCIP1 addition: 0hr (DMSO), 15 min, 1 h, 2 h, and 4 h. b. Browser tracks of Pol II Ser2 phos, Pol II Ser5 phos, H3K27ac, and BRD4 at BCL6-target genes and TCIP1-upregulated genes FOXO3 and BCL2L11/BIM. c. Volcano plots of Pol II ser 2 phos, Pol II ser 5 phos, and H3K27ac after 2 h 10 nM TCIP1 addition. Adjusted p-values computed by two-sided Wald test and adjusted for multiple comparisons by Benjamini-Hochberg. Peaks were classified as differential after reads in peaks-based regulative log expression (RLE) normalization and cutoffs padj ≤ 0.05 and |log2(Drug/DMSO)|≥0.5. d. Enhancer and super-enhancer classification in KARPAS422 cells based on H3K27ac ChIP-seq and the ROSE algorithm (Methods). e. BRD4 and H3K27ac ChIP-seq track at the known OCA-B super-enhancer after TCIP1 addition for indicated timepoints. In b, e, Pol II Ser2 phos, Pol II Ser5 phos, and H3K27ac tracks in are spike-in- and input-normalized, BRD4 tracks are sequence-depth- and input-normalized.', 'caption_zh': 'a. 在加入10 nM TCIP1处理各指定时间点 (0小时/DMSO、15分钟、1小时、2小时和4小时) 的各ChIP-seq实验主成分分析 (PCA) 散点图。b. 在BCL6靶基因以及TCIP1显著上调基因FOXO3和BCL2L11/BIM基因位点处，RNA聚合酶II Ser2磷酸化、Ser5磷酸化、H3K27ac以及BRD4的基因组浏览器精细比对轨迹图 (Browser tracks)。c. 加入10 nM TCIP1处理2小时后，RNA Pol II Ser2磷酸化、Ser5磷酸化以及H3K27ac富集峰改变的火山图。校正P值通过双侧Wald检验计算，并采用Benjamini-Hochberg法进行多重比较校正；富集峰在基于峰内reads数的相对对数表达 (RLE) 归一化后，依据padj ≤ 0.05且|log2(药物/DMSO)| ≥ 0.5的标准界定为差异显著峰。d. 基于H3K27ac ChIP-seq信号和ROSE生物信息学算法，在KARPAS422细胞中对全基因组常规增强子与超级增强子进行的等级排序与分类划分 (详见研究方法)。e. 加入TCIP1处理指定时间后，在已知的经典OCA-B超级增强子位点处BRD4和H3K27ac的ChIP-seq富集轨迹图。在b和e中，Pol II Ser2磷酸化、Pol II Ser5磷酸化以及H3K27ac轨迹图均经过果蝇染色质外源内参 (spike-in) 归一化并扣除Input对照背景；BRD4轨迹图经过测序深度及Input对照背景归一化。', 'terms': [{'term': 'Pol II Ser2磷酸化激增与启动子逃逸 (Pol II Ser2P & Promoter Escape)', 'desc': '轨迹图清晰揭示：在BCL2L11和FOXO3等促凋亡基因上，原本因BCL6结合而停滞的RNA聚合酶II在TCIP1招募BRD4/P-TEFb后，CTD结构域的Ser2位点迅速发生强烈磷酸化，聚合酶顺利冲出启动子暂停区，全长mRNA转录延伸效率呈爆发式增长。'}, {'term': 'OCA-B 超级增强子 (POU2AF1 Super-enhancer)', 'desc': 'B淋巴细胞特异性超强顺式调控元件，受BRD4高密度占据。ChIP-seq轨迹证实TCIP1处理后BRD4从超级增强子被重新分配与重布线至BCL6结合位点，从而产生双重抗癌效应。'}]}, {'number': 9, 'id': 'ed-fig9', 'image': 'figures/ed_fig9.png', 'title_en': 'Extended Data Fig. 9 | Conversion of BCL6 auto-inhibitory pathway to feedforward loop.', 'title_zh': '扩展数据图 9 | 将BCL6自身负反馈抑制通路逆转为致命的前馈自放大致死循环', 'caption_en': 'a. Control Neg1 and Neg2 effect on BCL6 protein levels at 20 h treatment in KARPAS422 cells. b. Effect on BRD4 levels at 20 h treatment with TCIP1 in KARPAS422 cells. c. Kinetics of BCL6 upregulation in two separate DLBCL cell lines, KARPAS422 and SUDHL5, after addition of 10 nM TCIP1. Blots in a–c representative of 2 biological replicates (for SUDHL5) or 3 (for KARPAS422). d. Model for conversion of BCL6 auto-inhibitory circuit to a positive feedback loop.', 'caption_zh': 'a. 阴性对照分子Neg1和Neg2在KARPAS422细胞中处理20小时对BCL6蛋白表达水平的影响。b. 在KARPAS422细胞中用TCIP1处理20小时对BRD4总蛋白水平的影响。c. 在两种不同的DLBCL细胞系 (KARPAS422与SUDHL5) 中加入10 nM TCIP1后，BCL6蛋白表达上调的时间动力学检测印迹图。a–c中的免疫印迹图代表2次生物学重复 (针对SUDHL5) 或3次生物学重复 (针对KARPAS422)。d. 将BCL6原有的内源性自抑制负反馈回路逆转为正向自放大前馈死循环回路 (positive feedback / feedforward loop) 的分子机制模型示意图。', 'terms': [{'term': '自抑制转变为致命正反馈循环 (Auto-inhibitory to Feedforward Loop)', 'desc': '在正常生发中心生理状态下，BCL6能结合自身启动子和内含子超级增强子，行使负反馈“刹车”防止蛋白过度蓄积；TCIP1将BCL6自身位点由转录抑制转变为强效激活，导致BCL6自身mRNA与蛋白表达暴增3至5倍；新合成的BCL6蛋白进一步结合TCIP1招募更多BRD4，形成自催化、自放大的恶性正反馈循环，以指数级速率持续加剧促凋亡基因的表达，直至癌细胞完全瓦解凋亡。'}]}]}
